(;B[aa]C[The 1-1 point. White must capture two stones from one side or the other, and each time he has to fill his own space, so only a two point eye is left. RIGHT])
(;B[ca];W[aa]C[Black puts his own two stones in atari; after the capture White has an eye in the corner and one on the second line.])
(;B[ab];W[ca]C[Both black stones are now dead: Black cannot connect at the 1-1 point, and White ends with an eye on the second line and one at b1.]))
